  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A point mass of 5 kg is placed at point P located on one of three gravitational equipotential lines, each separated by a distance of 100 km, as shown.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>What is the initial acceleration of the point mass?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">4 m s<sup>−2</sup> to the left</li><li data-label=\"B\">4 m s<sup>−2</sup> to the right</li><li data-label=\"C\">20 m s<sup>−2</sup> to the left</li><li data-label=\"D\">20 m s<sup>−2</sup> to the right</li></ol>"
  },
